DrainSinkhorn 0.1.0

DrainSinkhorn is an outer execution layer for FlashSinkhorn.  It depends on
flash-sinkhorn 0.3.3.post1 and imports its fused shifted-potential kernels and
streaming transport-application routines at runtime.

FlashSinkhorn is developed by the OT Triton Lab and distributed under the MIT
License:

  https://github.com/ot-triton-lab/flash-sinkhorn

DrainSinkhorn's candidate-axis Triton program, screening controller, release
verification, and physical compaction are maintained in this repository.  No
FlashSinkhorn source file is vendored here.
